

**16.38. Expression as Infinite Series**

Let \(v\)=\(\pi u/(2K)\)

**16.38.1**

\(\vartheta_{s}(u)\)=\(\left[\frac{2\pi q^{U2}}{m^{V_{1}}m_{1}^{V_{2}}K}\right]^{1/2}\sum\limits_{u=0}^{ \infty}\ (-1)^{n}q^{n(u+1)}\sin\ (2n+1)v\)

**16.38.2**

\(\vartheta_{c}(u)\)=\(\left[\frac{2\pi q^{U2}}{m^{V_{2}}K}\right]^{1/2}\sum\limits_{u=0}^{\infty}\ q^{n(u+1)}\cos\ (2n+1)v\)

**16.38.3**

\(\vartheta_{d}(u)\)=\(\left[\frac{\pi}{2K}\right]^{1/2}\left\{1+2\sum\limits_{u=1}^{\infty}q^{n^{2}}\cos\ 2nv\right\}\)

**16.38.4**

\(\vartheta_{s}(u)\)=\(\left[\frac{\pi}{2m^{V_{1}}K}\right]^{1/2}\left\{1+2\sum\limits_{u=1}^{\infty}\left(-1 \right)^{n}q^{n^{2}}\cos\ 2nv\right\}\)

**16.38.5**

\((2K/\pi)^{1/2}\)=\(1+2q+2q^{4}+2q^{4}+\ldots=\vartheta_{3}(0,q)\)

**16.38.6**

\((2K^{\prime}/\pi)^{1/2}\)=\(1+2q+2q^{4}+2q^{4}+\ldots=\vartheta_{3}(0,q_{i})\)

**16.38.7**

\((2m^{1/2}K/\pi)^{1/2}\)=\(2q^{1/4}(1+q^{4}+q^{4}+q^{4}+q^{4}+q^{4}+\ldots)\)

\(=\vartheta_{2}(0,q)\)

**16.38.8**

\((2m^{1/2}K/\pi)^{1/2}\)=\(1-2q+2q^{4}-2q^{4}+\ldots=\vartheta_{4}(0,q)\).

